  "description": "Less boilerplate. More Entity Framework. Small, optional EF Core helpers for Blazor: typed async CRUD, per-operation DbContext ownership, explicit assembly discovery and optional multi-provider transactions. Requires .NET 10 / EF Core 10; native EF APIs remain available.",
