  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Stable 2.0.0. Breaking changes from 1.0.5: requires .NET 10 / EF Core 10; native DbContext/IDbContextFactory and concrete provider DI replace legacy context, service and factory abstractions; async CRUD with cancellation and mapped entity keys replaces the old signatures; per-operation contexts and explicit transaction contexts replace implicit shared state. Full scalar updates, concurrency and missing-row contracts require migration review. Release notes: https://github.com/thliborius/EfCoreNexus/blob/v2.0.0/docs/release-notes-2.0.0.md",
